{"slug":"dallas-wings-flight-canceled-due-to-weather-conditions-in-dallas-after-tying-series-with-sun","postId":74812,"title":"Dallas Wings Flight Canceled Due To Weather Conditions In Dallas After Tying Series With Sun","htmlContent":"<!-- wp:image {\"id\":517458,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/maxresdefault-7-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-517458\"/><figcaption>YouTube</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Dallas Wings even the series with the Connecticut Sun in Connecticut 89-79. After the game, Wings' forward Isabelle Harrison tweeted that their flight was canceled back to Dallas. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"Hey, Cathy Engelbert, our flight got canceled. Can we get a charter?\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/OMG_itsizzyb/status/1561472055916331009?s=20u0026t=FNc1wOy7TiXquhSPIC7_jw\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/OMG_itsizzyb/status/1561472055916331009?s=20&amp;t=FNc1wOy7TiXquhSPIC7_jw\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This the second time in this month that the WNBA community has had to deal with cancelled flights this season. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Earlier this month, the Los Angeles Sparks were stranded in Washington after beating the Mystics almost three weeks ago. <a href=\"https://landonbuford.com/2022/08/08/the-los-angeles-sparks-are-stranded-at-the-airport-in-dc-after-canceled-flight/\">According to Sparks forward and President of the Players Association Nneka Ogwumike</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/nnekaogwumike/status/1556517155373551621?s=20u0026t=muGDeUzYXNPkR2itd9rxHQ\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/nnekaogwumike/status/1556517155373551621?s=20&amp;t=muGDeUzYXNPkR2itd9rxHQ\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Per WFAA's William Joy, \"Weather is having a major impact on flights right now. Flight Aware showing 1,108 Southwest flights and 722 American flights have been delayed. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"20% of DFW flights have been canceled and 29% delayed. 20% of Love Field flights delayed.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/WilliamJoy/status/1561477125470830593?s=20u0026t=muGDeUzYXNPkR2itd9rxHQ\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/WilliamJoy/status/1561477125470830593?s=20&amp;t=muGDeUzYXNPkR2itd9rxHQ\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>WNBA and NBA reporter Dorothy J. Gentry tweeted, \"It’s storming here in Dallas so likely weather-related but they need to get home safely. Please and thank you.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/DorothyJGentry/status/1561474509483511817?s=20u0026t=muGDeUzYXNPkR2itd9rxHQ\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/DorothyJGentry/status/1561474509483511817?s=20&amp;t=muGDeUzYXNPkR2itd9rxHQ\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Dallas Wings and Connecticut Sun to play game three on Wednesday August 24th at 9 pm EST. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://twitter.com/DorothyJGentry\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/DorothyJGentry\"></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->","excerpt":"YouTube The Dallas Wings even the series with the Connecticut Sun in Connecticut 89-79. After the game, Wings' forward Isabelle Harrison tweeted that their flight was canceled back to Dallas. \"Hey,…","publishedAt":"2022-08-22T05:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2022-08-22T05:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"chad-hughes","displayName":"Chad Hughes"},"categories":[{"slug":"sports","name":"Sports"},{"slug":"wnba","name":"WNBA"}],"tags":[{"slug":"connecticut-sun","name":"Connecticut Sun"},{"slug":"dallas-wings","name":"Dallas Wings"},{"slug":"isabelle-harrison","name":"Isabelle Harrison"},{"slug":"landon-buford","name":"Landon Buford"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/maxresdefault-7-1024x576.jpg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/maxresdefault-7-1024x576.jpg"],"readingTimeMin":1,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/dallas-wings-flight-canceled-due-to-weather-conditions-in-dallas-after-tying-series-with-sun/"}